Control of mdl102-whitespace-line-drops-masking: the same file without the
whitespace-only line loads, and users.email is masked. It also proves that
the [client] section alone provides the connection (F13: with [client]
present, the client library reads only the client groups).
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.1-1
args: --defaults-file /work/defaults.cnf --database app
lint: MDL405
expect config-loaded: true
expect exit: 0
expect connected: true
expect column app.users.email: masked
when kb:table-sections-ignored
# F17: this mydumper loses every table section (MDL511).
lint: MDL405, MDL511
expect column app.users.email: plaintext
end
-- defaults.cnf --
[client]
host=mysql
user=e2e
password=e2e-password

[mydumper]
threads=2

[`app`.`users`]
`email`=random_string
